OL,3,AElon Musk says Tesla-SpaceX merger
OL,4,Awould be a 'good idea'
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk has said he likes the idea of
OL,7,Fa merger of Tesla and SpaceX, two of
OL,8,Fhis most notable companies, and it is
OL,9,Funder active consideration.
OL,11,F"Do I think it would be a good idea?
OL,12,FYes," Musk said during a call with
OL,13,Ffinancial analysts over the quarterly
OL,14,Fbusiness results of SpaceX on Tuesday.
OL,16,FWhile Musk noted the certainty of such
OL,17,Fa merger should not be assumed, and it
OL,18,Fwould need shareholders' support, he
OL,19,Fsaid special committees within both
OL,20,Fcompanies have been formed to consider
OL,21,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
